import {TomeCluster,TomePortalEffect,TomeSweep,TomeFall,TomeRefill,tomeClusters,tomePendingPortal,tomeOtherWorldEffects,tomeAbyss,tomeVoid,tomeOpenEyes,tomeCollapse} from './TomeRules';

export interface TomeMega {row:number;column:number;}
export interface TomeStage {
 kind:'cascade'|'books'|'mega-enter'|'mega-step';before:number[];after:number[];
 wins:TomeCluster[];awards:number[];payout:number;removed:number[];
 chargeBefore:number;chargeAfter:number;openedBefore:number[];openedAfter:number[];
 effectsBefore:number;effectsAfter:number;effect?:TomePortalEffect;sweeps:TomeSweep[];
 voidSymbols:number[];spawned:number[];drops:TomeFall[];refills:TomeRefill[];
 megaBefore?:TomeMega;megaAfter?:TomeMega;
}
export interface TomeRoundOptions {
 board:number[];bet:number;pick:(cell:number)=>number;rng:()=>number;
 mode:'base'|'other-world';eyes?:number[];effects?:number;limit?:number;
}
export interface TomeRound {
 mode:TomeRoundOptions['mode'];opening:number[];board:number[];eyes:number[];
 opened:number[];stages:TomeStage[];payout:number;charge:number;effectsAwarded:number;
}
export function tomeMegaCells(mega:TomeMega):number[]{
 if(!Number.isInteger(mega.row)||mega.row<0||mega.row>5||!Number.isInteger(mega.column)||mega.column<0||mega.column>3)throw Error('Invalid Tome mega position');
 return [0,1].flatMap(y=>[0,1].flatMap(x=>mega.row+y<5?[(mega.row+y)*5+mega.column+x]:[]));
}
/** Mega is one moving overlay with an explicit footprint. Its four cells must
 * never be animated as four independent wilds. Vacated cells refill; newly
 * covered regular symbols are replaced without a payout or portal charge.
 * One-row descent is our current presentation interpretation (see slot doc). */
function moveMega(board:readonly number[],from:TomeMega|undefined,to:TomeMega|undefined,pick:(cell:number)=>number){
 const next=[...board],refills:TomeRefill[]=[];
 for(const cell of from?tomeMegaCells(from):[])next[cell]=-1;
 for(const cell of to?tomeMegaCells(to):[])next[cell]=10;
 for(let cell=0;cell<25;cell++)if(next[cell]<0){
  const symbol=pick(cell);if(!Number.isInteger(symbol)||symbol<0||symbol>9)throw Error('Invalid Tome refill');
  next[cell]=symbol;refills.push({to:cell,symbol});
 }
 return{board:next,refills};
}
/** Dedicated finite event sequence, deliberately not routed into live spins
 * until Cocos playback, distribution and the remaining source details pass QA.
 * Inputs make all random decisions here. Playback consumes stored events only.
 */
export function tomeRound(o:TomeRoundOptions):TomeRound{
 if(!Number.isFinite(o.bet)||o.bet<=0)throw Error('Invalid Tome bet');
 const limit=o.limit??o.bet*2000;
 if(!Number.isFinite(limit)||limit<0)throw Error('Invalid Tome payout limit');
 let board=[...o.board],opened:number[]=[],charge=0,paid=0,playedTier=0,pendingEyes=0;
 let effects=o.mode==='other-world'?o.effects??3:0;
 if(!Number.isInteger(effects)||effects<0||effects>7)throw Error('Invalid Tome effect count');
 const eyes=[...Array.from(new Set(o.eyes??[]))],stages:TomeStage[]=[];
 tomeClusters(board);tomeOpenEyes(eyes,[],[]);
 let effectMode:TomePortalEffect='wilds',mega:TomeMega|undefined,megaUsed=false;
 const choose=<T>(items:readonly T[]):T=>{
  const roll=o.rng();if(!(roll>=0&&roll<1)||!items.length)throw Error('Invalid Tome random choice');
  return items[Math.floor(roll*items.length)];
 };
 const start=(kind:TomeStage['kind']):TomeStage=>({kind,before:[...board],after:[],wins:[],awards:[],payout:0,removed:[],chargeBefore:charge,chargeAfter:charge,
  openedBefore:[...opened],openedAfter:[...opened],effectsBefore:effects,effectsAfter:effects,sweeps:[],voidSymbols:[],spawned:[],drops:[],refills:[],megaBefore:mega?{...mega}:undefined});
 const finish=(stage:TomeStage)=>{
  stage.after=[...board];stage.chargeAfter=charge;stage.openedAfter=[...opened];stage.effectsAfter=effects;stage.megaAfter=mega?{...mega}:undefined;stages.push(stage);
 };
 for(let turn=0;paid<limit;turn++){
  if(turn>=1024)throw Error('Tome cascades did not converge');
  const wins=tomeClusters(board);
  if(wins.length){
   const stage=start('cascade');stage.wins=wins;
   const winning=[...Array.from(new Set(wins.flatMap(w=>w.cells)))],removed=new Set(winning),books=winning.filter(cell=>board[cell]===8);
   for(const win of wins){const award=Math.min(limit-paid,Math.round(o.bet*win.multiple));stage.awards.push(award);stage.payout+=award;paid+=award;}
   const marks=tomeOpenEyes(eyes,opened,winning);opened=marks.opened;
   if(o.mode==='base')pendingEyes+=marks.newlyOpened.length;
   if(books.length&&effectMode==='abyss'){
    const result=tomeAbyss(board,books,()=>choose(['row','column'] as const));stage.sweeps=result.sweeps;result.removed.forEach(cell=>removed.add(cell));stage.effect='abyss';
   }else if(books.length&&effectMode==='void'){
    // GRS1485: VOID chooses ONE regular symbol when the effect triggers.
    // Multiple winning books do not independently remove additional kinds.
    const choices=[...Array.from(new Set(board.filter(symbol=>symbol>=0&&symbol<8)))];
    if(choices.length){const symbol=choose(choices);stage.voidSymbols.push(symbol);tomeVoid(board,symbol).forEach(cell=>removed.add(cell));}
    stage.effect='void';
   }
   stage.removed=[...Array.from(removed)].sort((a,b)=>a-b);
   if(o.mode==='base')charge+=stage.removed.filter(cell=>board[cell]!==10).length;
   // The mega footprint persists over the cascade, then moves as a single node.
   const footprint=mega?tomeMegaCells(mega):[];
   if(mega){
    // Do not let normal column collapse split or drag an existing mega footprint.
    board=stage.before.map((symbol,cell)=>footprint.includes(cell)?10:stage.removed.includes(cell)?-1:symbol);
    const stable=collapseAroundMega(board,footprint,o.pick);board=stable.board;stage.drops=stable.drops;stage.refills=stable.refills;
   }else{
    const collapse=tomeCollapse(board,stage.removed,o.pick);board=collapse.board;stage.drops=collapse.drops;stage.refills=collapse.refills;
   }
   finish(stage);
  }else if(mega){
   const stage=start('mega-step'),to=mega.row<4?{...mega,row:mega.row+1}:undefined;
   const moved=moveMega(board,mega,to,o.pick);board=moved.board;stage.refills=moved.refills;mega=to;finish(stage);
   continue;
  }else{
   if(o.mode==='other-world'&&!megaUsed&&eyes.length>0&&opened.length===eyes.length){
    const stage=start('mega-enter');mega={row:0,column:choose([0,1,2,3])};megaUsed=true;
    const moved=moveMega(board,undefined,mega,o.pick);board=moved.board;stage.spawned=tomeMegaCells(mega);finish(stage);continue;
   }
   const pending=o.mode==='base'?tomePendingPortal(charge,playedTier):undefined;
   if(o.mode==='base'&&charge>=42)break;
   if(!pending&&!pendingEyes&&!effects)break;
   const stage=start('books');let count=2;
   if(pending){effectMode=pending.effect;playedTier=pending.tier;}
   else if(pendingEyes){pendingEyes--;effectMode='wilds';}
   else{effects--;count=4;effectMode=choose(['wilds','abyss','void'] as const);}
   stage.effect=effectMode;
   const available=board.flatMap((symbol,cell)=>symbol>=0&&symbol<8?[cell]:[]);
   if(available.length<count)throw Error('Tome has too few regular cells for a portal placement');
   for(let i=0;i<count;i++){const cell=choose(available);available.splice(available.indexOf(cell),1);board[cell]=8;stage.spawned.push(cell);}
   finish(stage);continue;
  }
  if(mega&&paid<limit){
   const stage=start('mega-step'),to=mega.row<4?{...mega,row:mega.row+1}:undefined;
   const moved=moveMega(board,mega,to,o.pick);board=moved.board;stage.refills=moved.refills;mega=to;finish(stage);
  }
 }
 return{mode:o.mode,opening:[...o.board],board,eyes,opened,stages,payout:paid,charge,effectsAwarded:o.mode==='base'?tomeOtherWorldEffects(charge):0};
}
function collapseAroundMega(board:number[],footprint:number[],pick:(cell:number)=>number){
 const fixed=new Set(footprint),after=Array<number>(25).fill(-1),drops:TomeFall[]=[],refills:TomeRefill[]=[];
 footprint.forEach(cell=>after[cell]=10);
 for(let col=0;col<5;col++){
  const cells=Array.from({length:5},(_,row)=>row*5+col).filter(cell=>!fixed.has(cell));
  const kept=cells.filter(cell=>board[cell]>=0),missing=cells.length-kept.length;
  for(let i=0;i<cells.length;i++){
   const to=cells[i];if(i<missing){const symbol=pick(to);if(!Number.isInteger(symbol)||symbol<0||symbol>9)throw Error('Invalid Tome refill');after[to]=symbol;refills.push({to,symbol});}
   else{const from=kept[i-missing];after[to]=board[from];drops.push({from,to,symbol:board[from]});}
  }
 }
 return{board:after,drops,refills};
}
